<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Andi Djemma</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1901–1965</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Andi Djemma was the datu, or king, of Luwu in South <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sulawesi">Sulawesi</a> from 1935. He declared Luwu's support for the Indonesian Republic in 1945 and led resistance to the returning <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch">Dutch</a> until his capture in 1946. He was named a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/national-hero-of-indonesia">National Hero of Indonesia</a> in 2002.</p></div>
